Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretNeeds. Recover the actual purpose behind recipient requests, separating essential performance from preferred form. Identify acceptable adaptations and nonnegotiable constraints, including evidence or specialist approval needed for unfamiliar materials or equipment. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
